            <div class="frame-content text-center">
                <h1 class="hero-heading">Hardware verification gaps cause <br><span class="text-error">avoidable
                        failures.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-subtext" style="max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                    Hidden shorts, power sequencing errors, and logic faults often slip through to production.
                    <br>We prevent costly respins with disciplined continuity testing, controlled power-on, and deep
                    functional validation.
                </p>
