                <h2 class="cta-heading">We’re building validation the right way.</h2>
                <p class="hero-subtext" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
                    We’re an upcoming engineering team focused on long-term reliability, not shortcuts.
                    <br>If you’re shaping hardware for tomorrow, we’d like to talk.
                </p>
                <div class="action-area">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Contact Us</a>
                </div>
            </div>
